Spring Shell project provides the infrastructure to create such a REPL (Read, Eval, Print Loop) application, letting you concentrate on implementing commands by using the familiar Spring programming model.\n\nSpring Shell includes advanced features (such as parsing, tab completion, colorization of output, fancy ASCII-art table display, input conversion, and validation), freeing you to focus on core command logic.\n\n--- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spring-projects/spring-shell/v4.0.2/spring-shell-docs/modules/ROOT/pages/customization/jline.adoc\n--- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spring-projects/spring-shell/v4.0.2/spring-shell-docs/modules/ROOT/pages/components.adoc\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1787270447495}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_sg8oQSHQIpSkUPBqmTrh4YJj|fc_019f4d49046b2ec1016a87952d93e087d09139f9f208fc3840", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "tests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/dedicated-layer-test-exclusions.txt:437:org.jline:jline-console\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/dedicated-layer-test-exclusions.txt:548:org.springframework.shell:spring-shell-core-autoconfigure\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/shared-layered-test-exclusions.txt:320:org.jline:jline-terminal-jna\ntests/tck-build-logic/src/main/resources/shared-layered-test-exclusions.txt:427:org.springframework.shell:spring-shell-core-autoconfigure\nmetadata/org.springframework.shell/spring-shell-core-autoconfigure/index.json:5:    \"source-code-url\" : \"https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/springframework/shell/spring-shell-core-autoconfigure/$version$/spring-shell-core-autoconfigure-$version$-sources.jar\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.shell/spring-shell-core-autoconfigure/index.json:6:    \"repository-url\" : \"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-shell\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.shell/spring-shell-core-autoconfigure/index.json:7:    \"test-code-url\" : \"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-shell/tr